,"role":"Ernest","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bQcW7UUHkPiCnBCRRtKIiA2cAro.jpg"},{"id":1186075,"name":"Tarek Boudali","role":"Sam","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ubhbt0kZ6TX0t0tBFWe50A4u22y.jpg"},{"id":1291810,"name":"Julien Arruti","role":"Alex","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8mW9D3GiTU6KNnNYUM1t7NhKPRY.jpg"},{"id":145123,"name":"Grégoire Ludig","role":"Paul","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4rQhpGNkgmgEmayXL6U1ngky6C9.jpg"},{"id":1285939,"name":"David Marsais","role":"Jean","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kcCsrBy6zilmuISCOPti7Wje9YU.jpg"},{"id":21171,"name":"Gérard Jugnot","role":"M. Schaudel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8fvIsaf0a5e60IvtNddKCcOZXFO.jpg"},{"id":16921,"name":"Clotilde Courau","role":"Mme Schaudel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jSy63zL0jdoQsSGzbUFZICZIrpW.jpg"},{"id":66032,"name":"Philippe Duquesne","role":"Agent Caillaud","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xbfJaGOn5k5tAJY5jUFnXjpopPy.jpg"},{"id":1577002,"name":"Charlotte Gabris","role":"Estelle","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xwx5u4pIjIfaitgQxxCfXZHJbl.jpg"},{"id":130454,"name":"David Salles","role":"Commissaire Laville","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/voeB1ez3lBky9dhc4QQukx50Bc3.jpg"},{"id":145197,"name":"Philippe Brigaud","role":"Monsieur Monet","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/53XO45oLt2hn3g7Wz6CQSYlB4tW.jpg"},{"id":2098340,"name":"Enzo Tomasini","role":"Rémi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9ES0xNBW1gRKOj9tMdqoA8K4vTv.jpg"},{"id":1884492,"name":"Vladimir Houbart","role":"Le forain","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bffwGWGL1Our6qethZdzSxbEnps.jpg"},{"id":1744894,"name":"Alice Dufour","role":"Copine Paul","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6IIxIwQ4CLFZeQV6jvrAfCHtGQT.jpg"},{"id":2098351,"name":"Sylvia Fasolo","role":"La strip-teaseuse","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/FD5egdOW8rsBWe9DBuiD2A2SJ0.jpg"},{"id":130453,"name":"Nicolas Grandhomme","role":"Policier caméra","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A2hjH8g0FDNnadKX5GdfuEP3DTn.jpg"},{"id":1552480,"name":"Raphaël Hidrot","role":"Le policier téléphone","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2yJpCJIyO9TprnFlFJPjv2MGTZm.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Babysitting - Una notte che spacca","overview":"Nel giorno del suo trentesimo compleanno, Franck riceve dal suo capo Marc l'incarico di fare da babysitter improvvisato al figlio, Remy, un bambino di 10 anni molto maleducato e molto arrabbiato col padre. Un volta arrivato alla villa di Marc, Franck viene raggiunto dai suoi migliori amici Alex e Sam, che vogliono festeggiare il suo compleanno in grande stile. A loro si aggiunge la bella Sonia, ex fiamma di Franck. Come rifiutare? Il mattino dopo la polizia informa Marc e sua moglie che la loro casa è devastata, la macchina è distrutta e Remy è sparito. Come ricostruire il corso degli eventi? Facile: nella villa è rimasta una videocamera con cui Franck e i suoi amici hanno filmato tutta la loro notte brava. Da qui inizia il film nel film.","tagline":"Una notte che spacca"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Looking for a baby-sitter for the night, Marc Schaudel entrusts his son Remy to the care of his employee Franck, a straight man. But the thing that Marc doesn't know, is that Franck is getting 30 years old this weekend and that his son Remy is a very capricious child. The next day, Marc and his wife Claire are awakened by a call from the police. Remy and Franck are missing, and the house is totally devastated. The police finds a camera in the leftovers. Marc, Claire and the police start watching the video that has been recorded the day before during the night and find out what happened to Franck and Remy."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Faute de baby-sitter pour le week-end, Marc Schaudel confie son fils Remy à Franck, son employé, \"un type sérieux\" selon lui. Sauf que Franck a 30 ans ce soir et que Rémy est un sale gosse capricieux. Au petit matin, Marc et sa femme Claire sont réveillés par un appel de la police. Rémy et Franck ont disparu ! Au milieu de leur maison saccagée, la police a retrouvé une caméra. Marc et Claire découvrent, hallucinés, les images tournées pendant la soirée.","tagline":"Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir un baby sitter ?"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vGd5OAhbJ5fVBOjivjRluSlfDVK.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vGd5OAhbJ5fVBOjivjRluSlfDVK.png","language":"it","width":744,"height":312},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fhyPIihduljGL3ihriRk2jP7vkF.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fhyPIihduljGL3ihriRk2jP7vkF.png","language":"fr","width":1845,"height":893},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7xHYQSwYyq4LBGBW33Ur1XRb2AF.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7xHYQSwYyq4LBGBW33Ur1XRb2AF.png","language":"fr","width":1474,"height":875},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/stkrg14UFfcH3VCb3J2BgsTtWqs.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/stkrg14UFfcH3VCb3J2BgsTtWqs.png","language":"fr","width":675,"height":399},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68gVpFQUfzTMI3UwaoqfgHmEBtx.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/68gVpFQUfzTMI3UwaoqfgHmEBtx.png","language":"fr","width":602,"height":297},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eMHDTCHCUJjBs4VaxAMqdDWKToA.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eMHDTCHCUJjBs4VaxAMqdDWKToA.png","language":"fr","width":2194,"height":1297},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nVpSJGPAQIak2mFbDBeo10OPF8l.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nVpSJGPAQIak2mFbDBeo10OPF8l.png","language":"fr","width":2194,"height":1297}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url